      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "# Habitat Sol — ACE-Step 1.5 XL SFT quality workflow\n\nQuality-first instrumental episode cue for the RTX 3090 (24 GB). XL SFT is the highest-quality ACE-Step 1.5 executor; the 1.7B planner balances composition quality with safe memory headroom on this 16 GB host.\n\n## Models\n- diffusion_models/acestep_v1.5_xl_sft_bf16.safetensors\n- text_encoders/qwen_0.6b_ace15.safetensors\n- text_encoders/qwen_1.7b_ace15.safetensors\n- vae/ace_1.5_vae.safetensors\n\n## Starting settings\n- 105 seconds; change the Duration node for shorter/longer cues\n- 50 steps, CFG 7, Euler/simple, shift 3\n- Batch 1 for predictable 24 GB VRAM use\n- 72 BPM, 4/4, D minor; change only when the episode calls for it\n- The same seed drives planning and diffusion\n\n## Habitat Sol prompt discipline\nKeep cues instrumental, intimate, mature, and human-scale. Describe one emotional arc. Avoid bombast, heroic space opera, trailer percussion, accidental vocals, and generic sci-fi spectacle. Generate several seeds and listen against the episode.\n\nBoth a lossless FLAC master and V0 MP3 delivery copy are written under output/audio/habitat-sol/."
      ],
      "color": "#222",
      "bgcolor": "#000"
    }
